OL,3,AMillions of wives in South Asia        
OL,4,Aunprotected from marital rape - study  
OL,6,FFailure to fully criminalise marital   
OL,7,Frape leaves millions of women and girls
OL,8,Funprotected in eight South Asian       
OL,9,Fcountries, where intimate partner      
OL,10,Fviolence is 35% higher than the global 
OL,11,Faverage, says a new study.             
OL,13,FMore than 100 countries have outlawed  
OL,14,Fmarital rape, but a large part of South
OL,15,FAsia - India, Afghanistan, Sri Lanka   
OL,16,Fand Bangladesh - remain among the three
OL,17,Fdozen countries which haven't.         
OL,19,FThe only South Asian country where rape
OL,20,Fwithin marriage attracts the same      
OL,21,Fpenalty as any other rape is The       
OL,22,FMaldives.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
