OL,3,AMillions of wives in South Asia        
OL,4,Aunprotected from marital rape - study  
OL,6,FNepal and Bhutan have criminalised     
OL,7,Fmarital rape, but apply lesser         
OL,8,Fpenalties, says the study by Samaj, a  
OL,9,Fcoalition of women's rights groups in  
OL,10,Fthe region.                            
